--   probably why it did not come to mind.
--
--   It also corroborates the field-local barrier result from outside, after
--   the fact. Its `nd-p0-shadows-hypermath` says it is NOT derivable "that
--   this layer instantiates hypermath's P0. Entry conditions, fixed points and
--   barriers all differ. Anything asserting a single P0 theory across fields
--   is a combination claim and belongs in metamathethicology, per the
--   placement rule: a field states its own subject once." Written in another
